# {{label|en|mining, waste management}} The [[breaking]] or [[grinding]] up of a material to form smaller [[particle]]s.
# {{label|en|traumatology}} Fracture of a bone site in multiple [[piece]]s (at least three); [[crumbling]].

====Synonyms====
* [[crushing]], [[pulverization]]
* [[comminuted fracture]]

====Usage notes====
Differs from [[compound]] = [[open fracture]]. ([[Mix form]]s do happen though.)

